From e57ee31e44c561d3b90679cdc1443e51a3f3a94a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: hoangvu12 <hggaming91@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 6 Nov 2026 15:33:37 +0700
Subject: [PATCH] nightly: zgx with Windows' glass, caption colours and the
 cursor and GetDC fixes

Points v3's zgx at hoangvu12/zgx nightly/v3-zgx (f29cf3dc). That is
zeron/zgx's pin plus zeronsh/zgx#1495 and #1496, zgx's fix for the
cursor under pointer_events none, and zeronsh/zgx#1500: popups show
zgx's cursor, and a window no longer leaks a GDI handle each second
until GetDC fails. Drop this once zeron/zgx pins a zgx with all of them.
